    "back": "<p>ABCD is a parallelogram because its diagonals bisect each other.</p><svg style=\"width:100%;max-width:400px;max-height:230px;display:block;margin:8px auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 310 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Labelled geometry diagram\"><polyline points=\"45.00,150.00 215.00,150.00 265.00,50.00 95.00,50.00 45.00,150.00\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#254657\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"27.70303692821051\" y=\"162.8622559417225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193b50\" font-size=\"16\">A</text><text x=\"229.59620431235015\" y=\"167.1635035936251\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193b50\" font-size=\"16\">B</text><text x=\"282.2969630717895\" y=\"47.137744058277505\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193b50\" font-size=\"16\">C</text><text x=\"80.40379568764986\" y=\"42.836496406374884\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193b50\" font-size=\"16\">D</text><polyline points=\"45.00,150.00 265.00,50.00\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#254657\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polyline points=\"215.00,150.00 95.00,50.00\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#254657\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"159.0\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193b50\" font-size=\"16\">E</text><polyline points=\"97.93,120.45 102.07,129.55\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00766e\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polyline points=\"184.10,130.76 190.51,123.08\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00766e\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polyline points=\"179.49,126.92 185.90,119.24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00766e\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polyline points=\"212.07,79.55 207.93,70.45\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00766e\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polyline points=\"125.90,69.24 119.49,76.92\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00766e\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polyline points=\"130.51,73.08 124.10,80.76\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00766e\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg>"
