  "s3-formula-ch13-08": {
    "front": "<h2>P lies on the segment from A(x₁, y₁) to B(x₂, y₂). If AP : PB = r : s, what are the coordinates of P?</h2><svg style=\"width:100%;max-width:470px;max-height:205px;display:block;margin:12px auto\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"P divides AB in ratio r to s\" viewBox=\"0 0 365 170\"><path d=\"M80 112L244 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#246381\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"112\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#125761\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#17334a\">A(x₁, y₁)</text><circle cx=\"244\" cy=\"48\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#125761\"/><text x=\"249\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#17334a\">B(x₂, y₂)</text><circle cx=\"178.4\" cy=\"73.6\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#125761\"/><text x=\"183.4\" y=\"65.6\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#17334a\">P</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#17334a\">r</text><text x=\"213\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#17334a\">s</text></svg>",
    "back": "<svg style=\"width:100%;max-width:470px;max-height:205px;display:block;margin:12px auto\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"P divides AB in ratio r to s\" viewBox=\"0 0 365 170\"><path d=\"M80 112L244 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#246381\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"112\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#125761\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#17334a\">A(x₁, y₁)</text><circle cx=\"244\" cy=\"48\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#125761\"/><text x=\"249\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#17334a\">B(x₂, y₂)</text><circle cx=\"178.4\" cy=\"73.6\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#125761\"/><text x=\"183.4\" y=\"65.6\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#17334a\">P</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#17334a\">r</text><text x=\"213\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#17334a\">s</text><g class=\"work\"></g></svg><p>P = ((sx₁ + rx₂)/(r + s), (sy₁ + ry₂)/(r + s)).</p>"
  }
